    <briefdescription>
<para>Globally visible switch to turn console output from classes on/off. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>P. Lang </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>Aug 2011</para>
</simplesect>
To improve global status of the verbose variable. No explicit instantiation required any more.</para>
<para>Usage:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&quot;GlobalVerbose.h&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">bool&amp;<sp/>global_verbose(<sp/>GlobalVerbose::Instance().globalVerbose<sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
